.TH SCHED_GETAFFINITY 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_getaffinity \- gets a thread cpu affinity into a linux cpu bitmap of size bytes; process zero selects the caller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_getaffinity(pid_t process, size_t size, void* mask);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Gets a thread CPU affinity into a Linux CPU bitmap of size bytes; process zero selects the caller. Returns zero on success and clears unused trailing bytes.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_getaffinity (2)
